sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Chargewire server
  C->>S: POST …/statements, Prefer: wait=30<br/>Chargewire-Result-Partitions: 4, Chargewire-Result-Order: preserve
  S-->>C: statement document: k partitions, partition_order "interleaved"
  par one connection per partition
    C->>S: GET …/result?partition=0
    S-->>C: batches 0, k, 2k, …
  and
    C->>S: GET …/result?partition=1
    S-->>C: batches 1, k+1, …
  and
    C->>S: GET …/result?partition=k-1
    S-->>C: batches k-1, 2k-1, …
  end
  Note over C: every partition read to its end-of-stream marker,<br/>then batches taken round robin: the result in order
